  "idea": "Canva vs Figma: which design tool is better for marketing teams",
  "text": "Canva or Figma: which design tool should your marketing team actually use? Marketers waste hours struggling with Figma's auto-layout rules just to resize a simple promo banner. Forcing non-designers into vector software creates asset bottlenecks and floods your UI team with trivial edit requests. Build locked brand kits inside Canva for marketing while keeping Figma exclusive to core product design. This workflow ships creative assets ten times faster.",
